++ docs/mermaid/frontend-flow.mmd
flowchart LR
  User --> FE[Frontend UI]
  FE -->|Create scan| API1[/POST /api/scans/]
  API1 --> SCAN[Scan + Targets created]
  SCAN --> QUEUE[POST /api/scans/{id}/start]
  QUEUE --> Worker[Celery worker]
  Worker --> Nmap[Nmap discovery + service detection]
  Worker --> Nuclei[Nuclei per port\n(scan_mode, exclusions, tag validation)]
  Nmap --> DB[(DB)]
  Nuclei --> DB
  FE <-->|GET /api/scans/{id}| API2
  FE <-->|GET /api/scans/{id}/ports| API3
  FE <-->|GET /api/scans/{id}/vulnerabilities| API4
  DB --> API2
  DB --> API3
  DB --> API4
  API2 --> FE
  API3 --> FE
  API4 --> FE
